{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"警方佐敦截查私家車　檢獲毒品拘捕司機\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/DRUG-CAR-261102-22.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】警方在佐敦截查一輛私家車，檢獲毒品拘捕司機。</p><p>涉案男子在警車上協助調查。警方晚上7時在佐敦道與德興街交界發現一輛私家車車頭損毀，司機形跡可疑，於是上前截查，在車廂內發現多包懷疑毒品，包括依托咪酯煙彈及可卡因，當場拘捕司機。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T15:01:02.559154+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T14:07:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T15:18:33.845752+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:58:34.428673+00:00","content_hash":"6df032c7e05dc855b8afb68609d82428d71f8bb2eb8b82539bb25b389a58c13e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}